# Athlete Fatigue Risk Prediction

A Streamlit web application that predicts whether an athlete is at low or high fatigue risk using training and physiological metrics.

## Features
- HRV
- Heart Rate Recovery
- Cortisol Level
- Sleep Quality
- Sleep Hours
- Muscle Soreness
- RPE
- Training Hours
- Training Intensity

## Technologies
- Python
- Streamlit
- Scikit-learn
- Pandas
- Joblib